          "value": "<p>A creature coated by the sprayer is <strong>mustarded</strong> until it or an ally uses an action to wipe it off (or it is doused in water). While mustarded a creature has disadvantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks, Fawful's constructs have advantage on attack rolls against it (the sensors smell it), and the first time it takes fire damage the mustard flares for an extra 1d6 fire damage.</p>",
